---
// DesignPhilosophy.astro
---
<section class="philosophy container">
  <div class="structural-bg" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
  <div class="philosophy-content">
    <h2 class="text-uppercase font-serif reveal-up">Philosophy</h2>
    
    <div class="philosophy-words">
      <span class="reveal-up delay-1 font-serif italic text-accent">Space.</span>
      <span class="reveal-up delay-2 font-sans">Material.</span>
      <span class="reveal-up delay-3 font-serif italic text-accent">Light.</span>
      <span class="reveal-up delay-4 font-sans">Detail.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="philosophy-desc reveal-up delay-1">
      <p>Every element is a conscious decision. We strip away the unnecessary to reveal the essential character of a space. Our bespoke interior architecture prioritizes texture, natural light, and structural purity, creating timeless sanctuaries in the heart of Mumbai and beyond.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .structural-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-size: clamp(10rem, 35vw, 40rem);
    font-family: var(--f-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.8;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(28, 27, 26, 0.05);
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .philosophy-content h2 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .philosophy-words {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .philosophy-desc {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
